  ;; dispatch/scheduling operations coordination-only (voyage/ridership/
  ;; incident-report logging, crossing-schedule proposals, maintenance-
  ;; order coordination, safety-concern flagging). Highest-stakes
  ;; passenger-safety dimension among this batch's passenger classes
  ;; (historical ferry-disaster risk: overloading, capsizing) -- the
  ;; closed op allowlist NEVER includes any op that could finalize a
  ;; vessel-seaworthiness clearance, override a certified
  ;; passenger-capacity limit, or make a captain-fitness determination.

